   "id": "rc:1295821775",
   "kind": "maintenance",
   "part": 1,
   "pin": null,
   "question": "",
   "quote": "This is fragile, because when the type of `oldest_block_announcement` changes, the log output will change, too, without a compile error. It would be better to use `Ticks` or `TicksSinceEpoch`.",
